1
00:00:02,029 --> 00:00:04,570
As Uke comes to grab your wrist with both hands

2
00:00:04,571 --> 00:00:05,841
extend towards him

3
00:00:05,842 --> 00:00:09,008
using his momentum bring him around 
in a big circular movement, 

4
00:00:09,309 --> 00:00:11,273
separating his hands,
extending up

5
00:00:11,274 --> 00:00:13,082
droping your body below his center,

6
00:00:13,083 --> 00:00:15,008
taking him over your body for the throw.

